  "text": "The wind howls through the empty hall. Three knocks echo from the sealed door—sharp, deliberate. Her breath hitches. She steps back, hand on the cold metal handle. Then, from behind the wood, her own voice whispers, clear and urgent: Do not open it. She freezes. The words coil around her, familiar yet alien. Her fingers tremble. The door remains shut. The voice fades. Silence. But the echo lingers—her own voice, warning her from within."
}
